('5e3804d9057fd3f6fc80efc0','Plain Curd','Curd is a dairy product obtained by coagulating milk in a process called curdling. The coagulation can be caused by adding any edible acidic substance such as lemon juice or vinegar, and then allowing it to coagulate. The increased acidity causes the milk proteins to tangle into solid masses or curds.','Vegetable (Dry)',false,ARRAY['curd','plain curd','dahi','thair','yogurt','Plane Curd','Plane Kurd','Plain Kurd','Mosru','Thair','Thayer','Dai','Dahi','Mosaru','Plain Mosru','Plain Thair','Plain Thayer','Plain Dai','Plain Dahi','Plain Mosaru','Plane Mosru','Plane Thair','Plane Thayer','Plane Dai','Plane Dahi','Plane Mosaru']::text[],NULL,3,'{"active_time":3,"difficulty_level":"easy","nutrients":[{"name":"Calories","unit":"cal","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Protien","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Fat","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Carb","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Carbohydrates","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Vitamins","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Minerals","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Water","unit":"liters","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"iron","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Cholesterol","unit":"mg","daily_value":0,"qty":0}],"ratings":0}'),('5e38059d057fd3f6fc80efc2','Herbal Tea','Herbal tea is a warm and comforting beverage that can be had at any time fo day. It''s extremely simple to make, just add a tea bag to hot water.','Beverage (Hot)',false,ARRAY['herbal chai','Herbel Tea','Herbal Chai','Herbal Chaaya','Herbal T','Herbal Chaa','Herbal Tee','Herbel Chai','Herbel Chaaya','Herbel T','Herbel Chaa','Herbel Tee']::text[],NULL,5,'{"active_time":5,"difficulty_level":"easy","nutrients":[{"name":"Calories","unit":"cal","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Protien","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Fat","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Carb","unit":"g","daily_value":0,"qty":0},{"name":"Carbohydrates",